  "passages": [
    {
      "id": "chang-qu",
      "page": 75,
      "region": "right half, below heading 安文昌文曲星訣",
      "reading": "文昌星從戌上起子時如人生子時就在戌宮安之丑時逆至酉宮安之文曲星從辰上起子時若人生子時就在辰宮安之丑時順去巳宮安之餘宮仿此",
      "finding": "Both explanatory columns are legible. They independently support Chang from Xu backwards and Qu from Chen forwards by birth hour. A dark patch above affects an adjacent verse column; no reconstruction of that patch is claimed."
    },
    {
      "id": "zuo-you",
      "page": 75,
      "region": "right final heading and left first columns 安左輔右弼星訣",
      "reading": "左輔從辰上起正月順行如正月生者就辰宮安之二月在巳宮右弼從戌宮逆轉如正月就在戌宮安之二月在酉宮餘依此",
      "finding": "Normal-month direction and starting branches support the current formula. No leap-month extension inferred from this paragraph."
